  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/348126/Spheres-Apocrypha-Radiant-and-Righteous?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: Radiant and Righteous</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Guardian sphere (Defend Other), Life sphere (Empathic Healing).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use the Defend Other talent to grant an ally a bonus to their armor class, you may cure or restore your ally as part of that action but take an equal amount of damage when you cure them or use the Empathic Healing talent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc54\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
